    "Description": "The httpd packages provide the Apache HTTP Server, a powerful, efficient, and extensible web server.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* httpd: HTTP/2: Remote Denial of Service via compression bomb and Slowloris-style attack (CVE-2026-49975)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
